    <string name="file_browser_free_mode_disclaimer">Free browsing also opens internal storage folders outside Downloads and USB.\n\nThese folders can contain files used by the car screen, maps, camera recordings and other apps. Deleting the wrong file can make an app or the screen stop working properly, and deleted files cannot be recovered.\n\nPrivate app data and system partitions stay closed in this mode too.\n\nYou are responsible for every deletion and change you make in this mode. Do not touch files you are unsure about.</string>
